From 4c5aff9171dba01e95f20e4fbbb9ed7f45a64120 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:20:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(compiler): treat nested brand tables as primitive Map
 keys

Effect Schema brands are string & Brand<"Name">, where Brand is a nested
phantom marker object, not a flat { __brand } intersection. Erase those
nested marker tables to the underlying primitive so Map/Set keys type-check
the same as string/number/bigint/boolean.

Fixes #2912
